.PP
.SH "6\&.4\&.0"
.PP
Whoa this is a big one! \fR6\&.4\&.0\fP brings all the data loading and mutation APIs over from Remix\&. Here's a quick high level overview, but it's recommended you go check out the \fRdocs\fP, especially the \fRfeature overview\fP and the \fRtutorial\fP\&.

.PP
\fBNew APIs\fP

.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
Create your router with \fRcreateMemoryRouter\fP
.IP "\(bu" 2
Render your router with \fR<RouterProvider>\fP
.IP "\(bu" 2
Load data with a Route \fRloader\fP and mutate with a Route \fRaction\fP
.IP "\(bu" 2
Handle errors with Route \fRerrorElement\fP
.IP "\(bu" 2
Defer non-critical data with \fRdefer\fP and \fRAwait\fP
.PP

.PP
\fBBug Fixes\fP

.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
Path resolution is now trailing slash agnostic (#8861)
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRuseLocation\fP returns the scoped location inside a \fR<Routes location>\fP component (#9094)
.PP

